      "name": "dsh-toolbox",
      "title": {
        "en": "YuFeng · Windows Toolbox",
        "zh": "御风 · Windows 工具箱"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "Select text in any app and press the hotkey to translate it in place. Drives Win32 through DSH's bundled koffi FFI: no separate executable, no Python. Bundles the Edge translation extension and installs it with step-by-step guidance. Defaults to Hearthcore (dsh-npu); any OpenAI-compatible endpoint can be added in the panel.",
        "zh": "在任意应用里划词选中，按热键就地转译。通过 DSH 自带的 koffi（FFI）直调 Win32：无需独立 exe，无需 Python。内置 Edge 翻译扩展，分步骤引导安装。默认走燧心，也可在面板里加任意 OpenAI 兼容服务。"
      },
